 error rate is down to 0.2%. No approval was needed because v5.0.0 had been healthy in production before.\n- **Incident:** I opened **INC-0001** (SEV2, payments-api), and it paged the on-call engineer. My first attempt timed out. I checked the incident list, found nothing had been created, and retried with the same idempotency key, so there's only one incident.\n\nNext, someone needs to find what's wrong with v5.1.0 before it's deployed again.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01RaTCFithNCqb8RK48LC2F2", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01Svo9u5J6K1aoyceKmywg7y", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01F9tuDWRFk8hsG8ZdRdqWqJ", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01Q9ByWAWuLnhTjLsDVQHwij", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01K6E7JVo2DTe6BuQJ7e1urn", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments-service"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_017x2tTR6e4Per1sCaBd4ktz", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments-gateway"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01AQM3ESWkGmcQmXz2FprT9z", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]},